VALUES ('MCK','bull_case','editorial_analysis','MCKESSON CORP''s position in pharmaceutical distribution, oncology and specialty platforms, medical products, and prescription-technology services can compound value if demand converts into durable share, pricing, and cash rather than temporary volume. Clinical evidence, regulatory approvals, intellectual property, physician familiarity, distribution, scale, and manufacturing quality can reinforce adoption. Operating leverage and disciplined reinvestment can expand per-share free cash flow when revenue quality, margins, and capital intensity improve together. Official filings and earnings materials create a quarterly scorecard for testing management''s claims against delivered results and cash conversion.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','MCK official investor materials','https://investor.mckesson.com/','Use the company''s official results, presentations, webcast replays, prepared remarks, and transcripts when the issuer makes them publicly available.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
