VALUES ('MPC','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for petroleum refining, marketing, logistics, renewable fuels, and the MPLX midstream interest can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Prices, spreads, and differentials can reduce earnings and asset values. Incidents, outages, leaks, remediation, or permit restrictions can interrupt cash flow. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','MPC SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001510295&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
