VALUES ('MPWR','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for high-performance analog and mixed-signal power semiconductors for computing, automotive, industrial, communications, and consumer markets can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Products can lose relevance as architectures, standards, or customer preferences change. Large customers, distributors, foundries, or partners can alter demand and bargaining power. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','MPWR SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001280452&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides MONOLITHIC POWER SYSTEMS INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
