VALUES ('MRNA','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for messenger-RNA vaccines and therapeutics, infectious-disease programs, oncology pipelines, clinical development, and platform manufacturing can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Trials, safety findings, recalls, or weak real-world outcomes can reduce value. Government and private payers can constrain price, access, or utilization. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','MRNA SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001682852&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides MODERNA INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
