VALUES ('MSI','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for public-safety communications, command-center software, video security, and managed services can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Products can lose relevance as architectures, standards, or customer preferences change. Large customers, distributors, foundries, or partners can alter demand and bargaining power. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','MSI SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000068505&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
