VALUES ('NWS','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for digital subscriptions, financial information, book publishing, real-estate listings, news media, and content licensing can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Consumers and advertisers can shift quickly across platforms and formats. Large commitments may not generate sufficient audience or cash returns. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','NWS SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001564708&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides NEWS CORP CLASS B''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
