VALUES ('ON','bull_case','editorial_analysis','ON SEMICONDUCTOR CORP''s position in power and sensing semiconductors for automotive, industrial, cloud, communications, and energy applications can compound value if demand converts into durable share, pricing, and cash rather than temporary volume. Product performance, installed workflows, intellectual property, developer or channel ecosystems, and switching costs can support share and pricing. Operating leverage and disciplined reinvestment can expand per-share free cash flow when revenue quality, margins, and capital intensity improve together. Official filings and earnings materials create a quarterly scorecard for testing management''s claims against delivered results and cash conversion.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ON official investor materials','https://investor.onsemi.com/','Use the company''s official results, presentations, webcast replays, prepared remarks, and transcripts when the issuer makes them publicly available.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
