VALUES ('ONDS','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for autonomous drone platforms, counter-UAS systems, industrial wireless networks, and mission software for defense, public safety, rail, and critical infrastructure can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Customer capital spending and large programs can shift abruptly. Materials, skilled labor, supplier performance, warranty, or certification failures can disrupt delivery. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','ONDS SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001646188&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides Ondas Holdings''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
