VALUES ('ONDS','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if Ondas Holdings cannot defend its position in autonomous drone platforms, counter-UAS systems, industrial wireless networks, and mission software for defense, public safety, rail, and critical infrastructure and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','ONDS SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001646188&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides Ondas Holdings''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
