VALUES ('PCG','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for regulated electricity and natural-gas service, wildfire mitigation, transmission, distribution, generation, and customer infrastructure can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Bills, politics, and customer pressure can delay or reduce recovery. Large generation, grid, and environmental projects can face delays or cost overruns. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','PCG SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001004980&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides PG&E CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
