VALUES ('PH','bull_case','editorial_analysis','Broad technologies, distribution, application engineering, aftermarket exposure, and decentralized operations can support durable returns. Aerospace recovery, automation, electrification, filtration, and portfolio productivity can expand margins and cash flow. Visible progress in aerospace and industrial can improve the durability and quality of earnings. Disciplined reinvestment and capital allocation can convert operating progress into per-share value.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','PH investor relations','https://investors.parker.com/','Official earnings releases, presentations, events, governance materials, and shareholder information published by the company.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
