VALUES ('PSKY','bull_case','editorial_analysis','PARAMOUNT SKYDANCE CORP CLASS B''s position in film and television studios, streaming, broadcast networks, cable brands, advertising, licensing, and global content distribution can compound value if demand converts into durable share, pricing, and cash rather than temporary volume. Content libraries, franchises, networks, infrastructure, data, distribution, and customer relationships can create scale and switching advantages. Operating leverage and disciplined reinvestment can expand per-share free cash flow when revenue quality, margins, and capital intensity improve together. Official filings and earnings materials create a quarterly scorecard for testing management''s claims against delivered results and cash conversion.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','PSKY official investor materials','https://ir.paramount.com/','Use the company''s official results, presentations, webcast replays, prepared remarks, and transcripts when the issuer makes them publicly available.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
